abl_signed-SM8750.elf is the ROCKNIX ABL v1.1.7 payload for SM8750 (AYN Odin 3),
extracted unchanged from the official release tarball:

  https://github.com/ROCKNIX/abl/releases/download/v1.1.7/rocknix-abl-v1.1.7.tar.gz
  tarball sha256: see PKGBUILD comment; the .sha256 sidecar is the release's own.

v1.1.7 is the version every Holodor test on this device ran on. v1.1.8 (2026-08-25)
changes the internal-vs-SD boot order and has not been tested with Holodor; bump
only after an on-device test.

The scripts in rocknix_abl/ are Holodor's versions of the ROCKNIX distribution's
packages/tools/rocknix-abl/sources (GPL-2.0). backup_abl.sh additionally copies
the backup to the SD card, and disable/enable_android_updates.sh are ours.
